# LF everywhere, Windows included: Biome and gofmt check for it, and a shell
# script (install.sh, the plugin's launch) won't run with CRLF. A batch file
# is the other way round: cmd misreads some lines without CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.onnx binary
